# Mario Golf: Advance Tour (USA), from power-on with the owner's save:
# title -> Quick Game -> character -> course -> hole 1 flyover -> aim view
# (overhead, mode-7) -> address view -> swing -> ball flight (overhead).
# Frames at 60/s, desktop twin, --option defaults.  Used by
# run_me_midframe_fixtures.sh; the ROM is not in the repository.
wait 600
press START 3
wait 300
press START 3
wait 300
press RIGHT 3
wait 60
press A 3
wait 150
press A 3
wait 150
press A 3
wait 150
press A 3
wait 150
press A 3
wait 900
press A 3
press A 3
wait 110
press A 2
wait 40
press A 2
wait 40
press A 2
wait 900
